---
import metrics from '../data/metrics.json';
---

<section id="arquitectura" class="py-28 px-6 max-w-6xl mx-auto">
  <div class="reveal">
    <div class="section-divider mb-6"></div>
    <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4">Arquitectura Técnica</h2>
    <p class="text-transit-text-mid text-lg max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">
      Feature-first con capas transversales core/, shared/ y data/. Arquitectura limpia con separación estricta de responsabilidades, 12 repositorios canónicos y ~260 ficheros .dart (~35.000 LOC).
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-10 mb-14 reveal" data-delay="100">
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-2 bg-transit-bg-raised/60 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono border border-transit-bg-raised">
      <span class="text-transit-accent font-semibold">Flutter</span> <span class="text-transit-text-lo">3.9.2+</span>
    </span>
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-2 bg-transit-bg-raised/60 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono border border-transit-bg-raised">
      <span class="text-transit-accent font-semibold">Dart</span> <span class="text-transit-text-lo">3.9</span>
    </span>
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-2 bg-transit-bg-raised/60 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono border border-transit-bg-raised">
      <span class="text-transit-accent font-semibold">Riverpod</span> <span class="text-transit-text-lo">2.6.1</span>
    </span>
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-2 bg-transit-bg-raised/60 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono border border-transit-bg-raised">
      <span class="text-transit-accent font-semibold">go_router</span> <span class="text-transit-text-lo">17.2</span>
    </span>
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-2 bg-transit-bg-raised/60 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono border border-transit-bg-raised">
      <span class="text-transit-accent font-semibold">freezed</span> <span class="text-transit-text-lo">3.x</span>
    </span>
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-2 bg-transit-bg-raised/60 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono border border-transit-bg-raised">
      <span class="text-transit-accent font-semibold">Supabase</span> <span class="text-transit-text-lo">PGRS+RLS+RT</span>
    </span>
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-2 bg-transit-bg-raised/60 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono border border-transit-bg-raised">
      <span class="text-transit-accent font-semibold">Hive</span> <span class="text-transit-text-lo">2.2</span>
    </span>
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-2 bg-transit-bg-raised/60 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono border border-transit-bg-raised">
      <span class="text-transit-accent font-semibold">flutter_map</span> <span class="text-transit-text-lo">7.0</span>
    </span>
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-2 bg-transit-bg-raised/60 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono border border-transit-bg-raised">
      <span class="text-transit-accent font-semibold">nfc_manager</span> <span class="text-transit-text-lo">3.5</span>
    </span>
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-2 bg-transit-bg-raised/60 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono border border-transit-bg-raised">
      <span class="text-transit-accent font-semibold">Firebase</span> <span class="text-transit-text-lo">FCM</span>
    </span>
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-2 bg-transit-bg-raised/60 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono border border-transit-bg-raised">
      <span class="text-transit-accent font-semibold">Sentry</span> <span class="text-transit-text-lo">8.14</span>
    </span>
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-2 bg-transit-bg-raised/60 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono border border-transit-bg-raised">
      <span class="text-transit-accent font-semibold">PostHog</span> <span class="text-transit-text-lo">5.24</span>
    </span>
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-2 bg-transit-bg-raised/60 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono border border-transit-bg-raised">
      <span class="text-transit-accent font-semibold">Astro</span> <span class="text-transit-text-lo">6</span>
    </span>
  </div>

  <div class="glass-card overflow-x-auto reveal" data-delay="200">
    <pre class="p-6 md:p-8 text-xs md:text-sm font-mono text-transit-text-mid leading-relaxed whitespace-pre overflow-x-auto">
lib/
  <span class="text-transit-accent">main.dart</span>            Bootstrap: Env &#8594; Hive &#8594; Supabase &#8594; MockData &#8594; ProviderScope
  <span class="text-transit-accent">app.dart</span>             MaterialApp.router (themeMode + locale + go_router)
  <span class="text-transit-state-info">core/</span>                router/ + theme/ + utils/
  <span class="text-transit-state-warning">data/</span>                Capa más profunda; NO depende de features/
    auth/            Auth repos (excepción documentada al patrón)
    mock/            MockDataService + MockRealtimeService
    cache/           Hive adapters + boxes (17 total, 2 cifradas)
    nfc/             NfcCardService + i18n de errores
    sync/            RealtimeChannelManager + OfflineSyncService
    &lt;entity>/        12 entidades &#215; 5 ficheros (abstract/remote/local/mock/provider)
  <span class="text-transit-state-success">features/</span>            ~25 features feature-first
  <span class="text-transit-accent">l10n/</span>                ARB es/en/ar (343 claves/locale) + generated/
  <span class="text-transit-text-hi">shared/</span>              models/ (27+ @freezed), providers/, widgets/ (27+)</pre>
  </div>

  <div class="glass-card p-6 mt-8 reveal border-l-4 border-transit-accent" data-delay="300">
    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-4 text-transit-accent">Reglas de Oro de la Arquitectura</h3>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-sm">
      <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
        <span class="text-transit-state-success mt-0.5 shrink-0 font-bold">&#10003;</span>
        <span class="text-transit-text-mid"><code class="text-transit-text-hi font-mono text-xs bg-transit-bg-root px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">data/</code> no depende de <code class="text-transit-text-hi font-mono text-xs bg-transit-bg-root px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">features/</code></span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
        <span class="text-transit-state-success mt-0.5 shrink-0 font-bold">&#10003;</span>
        <span class="text-transit-text-mid">Design tokens en <code class="text-transit-text-hi font-mono text-xs bg-transit-bg-root px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">core/theme/</code> se consumen, nunca se duplican</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
        <span class="text-transit-state-success mt-0.5 shrink-0 font-bold">&#10003;</span>
        <span class="text-transit-text-mid">Patrón de errores tipado (<code class="text-transit-text-hi font-mono text-xs bg-transit-bg-root px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">enum + class Exception</code>)</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
        <span class="text-transit-state-success mt-0.5 shrink-0 font-bold">&#10003;</span>
        <span class="text-transit-text-mid"><code class="text-transit-text-hi font-mono text-xs bg-transit-bg-root px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">avoid_print: true</code> &#183; <code class="text-transit-text-hi font-mono text-xs bg-transit-bg-root px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">strict-casts + strict-raw-types</code></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mt-8 reveal" data-delay="400">
    <div class="glass-card p-5 text-center">
      <div class="text-3xl font-bold font-mono text-transit-accent">{metrics.project.dartFiles}</div>
      <div class="text-xs text-transit-text-lo mt-1">ficheros .dart</div>
    </div>
    <div class="glass-card p-5 text-center">
      <div class="text-3xl font-bold font-mono text-transit-state-info">{metrics.project.loc}</div>
      <div class="text-xs text-transit-text-lo mt-1">líneas de código</div>
    </div>
    <div class="glass-card p-5 text-center">
      <div class="text-3xl font-bold font-mono text-transit-state-success">12</div>
      <div class="text-xs text-transit-text-lo mt-1">repos canónicos</div>
    </div>
    <div class="glass-card p-5 text-center">
      <div class="text-3xl font-bold font-mono text-transit-state-warning">27+</div>
      <div class="text-xs text-transit-text-lo mt-1">modelos @freezed</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
